  lines:
  - speaker: 1
    text: "Take care, it\u2019s probably the most important treasure in my collection.
      But unfortunately ... it doesn\u2019t belong to me. "
  - speaker: 1
    text: "I think it\u2019s time for its rightful owner to get it back. Go and climb
      the mountain to find her!"
  - speaker: 0
    text: 'But who is "her" ? How would I know who to give it to? '
  - speaker: 1
    text: "Look for a determined woman, I can\u2019t describe her to you otherwise.
      But when you see her and she talks to you, you will know that it is to her
      that you must hand over this object."
